      "statement": "open() initializes a brand-new workspace under blockConcurrencyWhile after verifying with the owner's User DO that the gadget exists (a shared-to-user record for a deleted gadget is treated as not-found so a different user cannot accidentally recreate it), runs ambient capsule reconciliation (awaited on first open, background afterwards), then enforces in order: prohibitAllSharing short-circuit, share-key redemption, sharing-graph effective role (denial exposes no workspace metadata), and ensureObserver after ambient reconciliation so every exposed capability has an observer; the resulting capability is the full OverseerClientInterface for owners/build collaborators and the restricted UseOverseerInterface for use collaborators.",
